<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">MGLT-OMUSEBEZI NO KUTOLOKA EBIBELE NO SILUYANA</book>
  <para style="h">Magalata</para>
  <para style="toc1">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi ku Magalata</para>
  <para style="toc2">Magalata</para>
  <para style="toc3">Magalata</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAGALATA</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebuka no Magalata kame ina kun̄oliwa kwa mutumiwa Paulusi (1.1). Neli elin̄olo elyo anakn̄ola Paulusi ku keleke no Magalata enakoinjili mukaci ka nako inakukwana makumi anee nimutanu nitwaatu (48) ni kutwala bamyaka makumi mutanu ni mutanu ni twiili (57) munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite. Amagalata mwendi neli anu ana kuyoyanga mu tolopo no Maloma mu Galata. Asi kukuiyeta kakwite oupaki noko anakwikalanga Paulusi aba ana kun̄ola elin̄oloeli, kono emilenen̄i yiili Efese ni Kolinte kame iyambutetwa nji mwana kwikalanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulusi kame ana kun̄ola okwambela alumeli, Amajuda bamweya nawo asimacaba, mu tikeleke mu Galata. Kame ana kun̄ola mu luli okwayuta etituto no mapwa eto tina kwamba nji alumeli kame afanena okukon̄elela omulao no majuda okutunda mu Tesitamende no kale, onene omupato. Kame kuna kwikala esikwata no anu esosina kwisaniwa nji Amajudaizasi ao ana kusaelanga nji, asimacaba nonyene atwaliwe ku mupato. Kasi kupumena amaata no utumiwa wa Paulusi. Paulusi na kuimanena outumiwa waye mu kwamba einjili no mikalelo yaye (1.11-2.14) mi kame ana kuimanena eliywi no kuwaba mu kutoloka nji okuyoyisa kame kutwesa okuwaniwa fela mu kupumena mwa Jesu Kilesite (2.16). Esi ni mulibaka ni makeke ao amonisa mi kasa eyo atenda anu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no titaba</para>
  <para style="io">Paulusi kame atateka elin̄ololyaye mu kukeeta etikeleke mu Galata (1.1-5).</para>
  <para style="io">Cwale Paulusi kame atoloka emiyoyelo yaye na kunyima okuimanena etukelo yaye no kuiyeta ni kumonisa nji naeteke okuyoya mukukon̄elela omulao kono eso kasisi ku sebeza (1.6-2.21).</para>
  <para style="io">Esisikon̄elelako, kame atoloka omusebezi no mulao ni sishemo mu kuyoyisiwa (3-4).</para>
  <para style="io">Cwale kame aba etitaelo mukupula ku muyoyelo no kuwaba no ulapeli (5-6.10)</para>
  <para style="io">Paulusi kame amana elin̄olo lyaye ni kukeeta mane ni kukumbela no mamaneneno mu kupuluka nji mukufulwa kwa Nyambe okutenda omunu no ubya ni kwautokwa onene nji emilaona bandee eyo no kuta ku mupato (6.11-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa Paulisi, omutumiwa kasa okutunda kwaanu simba okubitela mu munu, kono okubitela mwa Jesu Kilesite ni mwa Nyambe Sitange woyo ona kumwingula kwaafu. <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Onje abaange awo nili noo ku tikeleke na mu Galata.<verse eid="GAL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Esishemo ni kozo itunda kwa Nyambe Sitange ni kwa Jesu Kilesite Ombumu wetu iikale naanyi.<verse eid="GAL 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Woyo ona kukutoboha yonyene mulibaka no ibi yetu okutu tundisa ku kwiiba no litunga lino, okukumanena mukusinga kwa Nyambe ni Sitetu. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Kwa yonyene kwikale ekanya okuta oku no kwaabwa! Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eliywi Limweya no Kuwaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Kame ni komokile aba mufulalele wangu ngeso yonyene woyo ona miisanene mu sishemo sa Kilesite mane namu siulukele ku liywii no kuwaba lindina. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Kasa nji kame kuli ni liywii linjili, kono kame kuli anjili awo amikataza mane kame asinga okukandakanda eliywii no kuwaba lya Kilesite. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Kono simba aci simba elingeloi eli litunda ku wilu, aba sami iyete eliywi no kuwaba lindina kweeli tuna mikutaza, woyo munu kame sabiwe ekoto. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Kanyi omo tunambele kunyima, cwale nibano kame naamba kame, nji omunu yonje somikutaza eliywi no kuwaba lindina kweeli muna tambula, woyo munu kame sabiwe ekoto.<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Kana esi ni saela, ninji ni wabelise aanu nji Nyambe? Kana kame neteka okuwabelisa aanu! Nji nisi wabelisa aanu, kani fanene okutenda omubika wa Kilesite.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omo kuna Kwiyela nji Paulusi atenda Omutumiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Abaange, kame nisinga nji mulimuke nji eliywi no kuwaba nina kukutaza kalitundu ku munu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Kakuli kana siku litambula okutunda ku munu. Kono kame lina kwiiya mu sinulo ya Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Kakuli kame muna yupu omwikalelo wange nakunyima no Sijuda, omo nina kuyandiseta onene ekeleke ya Nyambe ni kwisinya. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Mu tuto no Sijunda, kame nina kusiya ataka ange no kupula, kame nina kwabita onene muku tukufalelwa emikwa no sizo no anjekulyange.<verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Kono cwale Nyambe woyo ona kunikete mekani sileiwa kale, kame ana niisana okubitela mu sishemo saye, <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>okuni monisa Mwanaye nji nika mukutaze mukaci no asimacaba, kanasi kweleziwa ku munu. <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>Kanasi kukambamena ku Jelusalema kwawo ana kutenda atumiwa oweli kwa mene, kono kame ina kuta mu Alabiya, mi kame sebeli nuuka ku Damaseka. <verse eid="GAL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Munyima no myaka yaatu sebeli nita ku Jelusalema okapotela Kefasi mane sebeli niikala naye amaywaa akwana likumi ni mutanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Kono kana sikukumona natumiwa anjili konji Jakobo minaye Mbumu.<verse eid="GAL 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Cwale, mweyo nimi n̄olela, balubala lwa Nyambe, kanoongo!<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Cwale sebeli nita ku ilalanda ya Siliya ni Silisiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Kana siku limukiwa okumoniwa ku tikeleke ta Kilesite mu Judeya. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Kame ana kuyupa fela nji, “Wuya ona ku tuyandisanga bano sebeli okutaza etumelo eyi ana kusinya oweli!” <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Cwale sebeli akanyisa Nyambe mulibaka lyange.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s">Paulusi na Tumiwa Anjili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Cwale munyima no myaka likumi ni tunee sebeli nita kame ku Jelusalema ni Bababasi mane ni Tite sebeli nita naye. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Kame nina kuta mulibaka no taelo ya Nyambe. Cwale sebeli nataluseta eliywi no kuwaba, kono kumukunda sebeli ni kuwana nawo ana kumonahala nji autokwa, eliywi no kuwaba elyo nikutaza mwa simacaba. Sisingi nji okwituka kwange nomo nina itukele kutende oko nambulwa tuso. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Kono simba Tite, woyo ona kwikala ni mene kasi kukandimekwa okwingena ku mupato naba atendile nji Mugelike. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Kono mulibaka no asikupumena no mapwa mukwalimuka sebeli tutenda ngeso, awo anaku kwingenyeka mu tukuluho yetu eyo tuli nayo mwa Kilesite Jesu nji atutende abika. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Katusi kwa sheteta okubeeka kunji yoo simba enako icana, nji eniti no liywi no kuwaba ikale kwaanyi.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Cwale okutunda kwawo ana kumonahala nji aendisi no utokwa, kakwisa eshutano ni mene, Nyambe kakwite esobozi, kame namba nji awo aliketwa nji autokwa kakwisa eso ana ekeze kwa mene. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Kono ba kulemuha aba ana kumona nji ina biwi omusebezi no kwambela awo aulwile omupato eliywi no kuwaba, kanyi omo ana kubelwa Pitolosi okwamba eliywi no kuwaba kwawo ana kwingena mu mupato. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Kakuli woyo ona sebeze mwa Pitlosi oku mutenda omutumiwa no asimupato, kame ana sebeze ngeso ni kwa mane oku nitenda omutumiwa wa asimacaba. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Mane aba ana kulemuha esishemo nina biwi, Jakobo, Kefasi ni Jowani awo ana kwaliketwa nji misumo, sebeli akulema bamweya ni mene ni Banabasi elyoko no silyo oulikani. Nji tute kwa simacaba mi onyene ate kwa simupato. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Fela onyene nji, tu pulukange ano kusheba, mi sokame eso nina tukufalele oku tenda.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo Kalimela Pitolosi ku Antiyoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Kono Kefasi enako ana kwiya mu Antiyoki, sebeli nimu kananisa balubala no aanu, kakuli kame ana kufanena okunyaziwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Kakuli baweli Jakobo yo kasituma kale alume anjili, Pitlosi kame ana ku lyanga na simacaba. Kono aba ana kukeela sebeli oukela munyima mane sebeli okukauhanya yonyene, mukucila asimupato. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Cwale yonyene ni Majuda anjili sebeli oulwa okumonisa eniti, nji cwale simba Banabasi sebeli oyembuluka ni kuulwa eniti koo. <verse eid="GAL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Kono aba nina kumona nji kakwite eniti okukumanena ni liywi no kuwaba, sebeli namba kwa Kayafa balubala loo onje nji, “Wene kame oli Mujuda, kono kame oyoya kanyi asimacaba. Cwale iikene aba okandimeka asimacaba okuyoya kanyi Majuda?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amajuda na Simacaba kame Asebelezwa ku Tumelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Aci, kame tuli aendisi no Majuda mu kuleiwa, kasa nji tuli asimacaba awo asikutenda eibi. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Mulibakaelyo, woyo oyii nji omunu kasi kenisiwa ni misebezi no mulawo, kono mu kupumena mwa Jesu Kilesite, mane simba nji natu pumene mwa Kilesite nji tukenisiwe mu kupumena mwa Kilesite kasa mu misebezi no mulawo kakuli omusebezi no mulawo kakwisa woyo sokenisiwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Kono nji, mukusinga kwetu okukenisiwa mwa Kilesite, aci twenyene na tuwaniwa metutenda eibi, kasa nji Kilesite yona liti esibi nji? Kokuulwa! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Kono kambe kame niingula einu nina kukwisa, cwale kambe kame ni yii nji kame nimatuka omulawo. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Kakuli mene mu mulawo kame ninafu mu mulawo, nji cwale ni yoyele kwa Nyambe, <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>kame nina ngongotelwa ni Kilesite ba sifapano, mi kasa mene woyo oyoya, kono ni Kilesite woyo oyoya mwa mene. Mi cwale omoyo ni yoya mu lutu, kame niyoya mulibaka no tumelo mwa Mwana Nyambe, woyo ona nisingi mane nikuniba omoyo waye. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Kani tamba okukana esishemo sa Nyambe, kakuli okukenisiwa kame kunakwiiya mu mulawo, cwale abohe Kilesite nafu oku nambulwa tuso.<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s">Omulawo simba Etumelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Anyi aelo Amagalata! Anyine ona milowo nji mu lesele okuyupa eniti, Jesu Kilesite kame ana kungongotelwa me mumwine! <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Esi ni miibanguta nesi, kana namu kutambula Emebo mulibaka no misebezi no mulawo nji muku yupa ni tumelo? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Naanyi muli aelo! Aba mu na tangisa ni Mebo, kana cwale kame musinga okuungule ni lutu? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Kana einu munabiti no kupula eyi nambulwa tuso? Niti luli kame ina kutalusa esinjili! <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Cwale Nyambe woyo omiba Emebo ni kutenda etimakazo mukaci kenu, kana kame aitenda mulibaka no misebezi no mulawo nji mulibaka no kuyupa ni tumelo?<verse eid="GAL 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Kanyi Abulahama aba ana kupumena Nyambe, mane sebeli obaliwa nji, “Wa kuluka.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Cwale mu lemuhe nji aanu no tumelo aana a Abulahama. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Cwale elin̄olo kame lyamba nji Nyambe mba kenisa asimacaba mulibaka no tumelo. Nalikutaziwa kwa Abulahama oweli okwamba nji, “Mwa wene emishobo yonje mba ifoyauliwa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Cwalehe aanu awo ali ni tumelo nafuyauliwa ni Abulahama woyo ona kwikala ni tumelo.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Kakuli onje awo asepile ba misebezi no Mulawo, kame ali munji no sikuto, kakuli kame ku n̄olilwe nji, “Ku kutiwe omunu yonje woyo no kwakon̄a eyo in̄olilwe mu buka no mulawo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Cwale uno oupaki nji kakwisa omunu okenine balubala lwa Nyambe mulibaka no mulawo. “Kakuli konji woyo okenisiwa mulibaka no tumelo, wakuluka yoso yoya.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Kono omulawo kausuminwe ba tumelo. “Kakuli woyo otenda etitaelo eto kame ayoya nato.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Kilesite natu liulula mu sikuto no Mulawo, muku tenda kanyi woyo no ku kutiwa mu libaka lyetu. Kakuli kame ku n̄olilwe nji, “Kukutiwe omunu yonje woyo otulekiwa ba sitondo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Nakutendahala ngeso nji embuyoti ya Abulahama iiye kwa simacaba mwa Kilesite Jesu, nji aci mu tumelo, tu tambule Emebo tuna kusepisiwa.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulawo ni Sepiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Abaange, okuba omwanda mu mukwa no unu. Kakwisa omunu otwesa okufutula okusinga kwa munu simba okuwekeza abo owa okongotwa kale. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Cwale etisepiso kame tina kubiwa kwa Abulahama ni lusika lwaye. Ka ku sambiwa nji, “Ni ku masika aye kanyi a kupula, kono ni “lumweya,” aba ku nambiwa nji, “Ni ku lusika lowe,” kame kutalusiwa Kilesite. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Cwale esi sokame eso nitalusa omulawo, owo ona kwiiya munyima no myaka ikwana emyanda inee ni makumi aatu (430) kausi mana oulikani ana koongota Nyambe nji cwale esepiso ni yonyene yuulwe okutendahala. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Kakuli nji okuyoola ni mulibaka no mulawo, abo cwale kasa nji ni mulibaka no sepiso, kono Nyambe na kuba Abulahama mu sepiso.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Abakulingesohe, omulawo ni wa ikene? Kame ona kwekeziwako mulibaka no tifoso, okutwala abo salwiyele olusika olo kwa woyo ona kulusepisiwa mane kame ona kulaeliwa ku Mangeloi mulibaka lya mwimaneni. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Cwale omwimaneni kasa wa no mumweya, kono Nyambe mumweya.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omusebezi no Mulawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Kana cwale omulawo kame ulwisa etisepiso ta Nyambe? Kokuulwa! kakuli nji omulawo kame ona kubiwa okuyoyisa, kambe okuluka naku kwiiya mulibaka no mulawo. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Kono elin̄olo kame lyamba nji esibi kame sendisa omunu yonje, nji cwale eso sina kusepisiwa ku tumelo mwa Jesu Kilesite nji sibiwe kwawo apumena.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Cwale etumelo ekaya siiya kale, kame tuna kubekiwa munji no Mulawo, me tutatelele okutwala abo etumelo saika monahalele. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Cwale omulawo neli omwendisi wetu okutwala aba ana kwiyela Kilesite nji tukenisiwe mulibaka no tumelo. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Kono cwale etumelo eyo aba ineeyi, ka tusili kame munji no mulawo.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Kakuli monje kame muli aana a Nyambe mwa Kilesite Jesu mulibaka no tumelo yenu. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Kakuli anyi monje aba mukolobelizwe mwa Kilesite namu kufuku Kilesite. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Kakwisa Mujuda, simba Mugelike, kakwisa omubika simba woyo noku lukuluha, kakwisa omulume simba omukati, kakuli monje kame muli mu umweya mwa Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Cwale nji kame muli a Kilesite, abohe kame muli asilusika lwa Abulahama, ayooli no sanda okukumanena ku sepiso ya Nyambe.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Kame ni talusa nji omuyoli no sanda kakwisa taba nji mwanuke kakwisa omo akusiyela ni mubika, naba atendile nji einu yonje niyaye. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Kono kame ali munji no aleli ni wa ikombwa, mane okutwala ba nako ana beeke sitaye. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Cwale naaci abo metusili aana, kame tuna kwikala mu ubika no mebo no litunga. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Kono enako aba ineeyi, Nyambe nakutuma Mwanaye. Nakuleiwa ku mukati mane okuleiwa munji no mulawo, <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>nji aliulule awo ali munji no Mulao, nji cwale tuwane okwan̄ulwa tu tende aana a Nyambe.<verse eid="GAL 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Mi cwale kakuli kame muli aana, Nyambe na tumene mu micima yetu Emebo ya Mwanaye, eikuwa nji, “Abba, Sitange!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Abakulingeso, ka musili abika, kono sebeli muli aana, mi nji kame muli aana mane mbamuyolo esaanda.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi Yopuluka eyi no Magalata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Ku nyima aba me mwakasilimuka kale Nyambe, kame muna kunungiwa ku milimu eyo kasa yokame luli. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Kono cwale aba muna limuka Nyambe simba okulikiwa kwa Nyambe, cwale ngasibine aba muukela kame mu ufokoli ni maata no mebo no kwiiba oubika owo musaela okubusiwa ku onyene kame? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Kame mu tokomela amaywaa, etikweti, etinako mane ni myaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Kame ni cila mulibaka lyenu! Nji mwendi kame nina misebeleze omo nambulwa tuso?<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Abaange, kame ni mikumbela, nji mufeke kanyi mene, kakuli mene kame ni ikalile kanyi anyi. Ka mu sini foseza. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Kame mu limuka nji neli mu ufokoli no lutu nji kame ina kukutaza eliywi no kuwaba kwaanyi ba weli. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Cwale okukumanena nomo nina kwikalela neli muliko kwaanyi, ka mwasiku ni kana simba okuni timba. Kono kame namu ni tambula kanyi elingeloi lya Nyambe, mane kanyi time Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Okuwabelelwa kwenu kame kuna bwele babine? Kakuli kame nimi paka nji, kambe kame kutwesahala, kambe kame mu na kutundisa amiyo enu ni kuniba wo. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Kana kame ni na futuka esila senu mu kumyambela eniti?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Kame ana mi tukufalele onene, kono kasa mu mukwa no kuwaba. Kame asaela oku mi tundisa kwa mene nji cwale mwatukufalelwe onene. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Kakuli esiwa ni ku tukufalelwa eyi no kuwaba enako yonje, kasa mu nako feela eyo nili naanyi. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Anange acana, anyi awo ni yupela kame okukola no kuleya, okutwala aba sa umbelwe Kilesite mwaanyi. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Kame ni shukelele okwikala naanyi cwale, ni ku futula omwambelo wange. Kakuli kame ni ziyelehile onene mulibaka lyenu.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omwanda wa Agale ni Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Mu nambele, anyi anyine osinga kwikala munji no Mulao, ka mu yupu omulawo? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Kakuli kame ku n̄olilwe nji Abulahama kame ana kwikala naana ayili, omunjili mwana inawaye neli mubika, omunjili inawaye neli waku lukuluka. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Kono omwana no mukati no mubika kame ana leiwa okukumanena ni lutu, kono omwana wa woyo osi kulukuluka kame ana leiwa mu sepiso. <verse eid="GAL 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Cwale eyi kame itendile enguli mi aa akati kame ali oulikani wiili. omunjili kame atunda ku lilundu no Sinai, woyo oleya aana no ubika, yokame Hagale. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Cwale Hagale yokame elilundu no Sanai lili mu Alabiya, yosi kwambola ku Jelusalema no bano, kakuli kame ana kwikala mu ubika naanaye. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Kono Jelusalema na ku wilu niwa ku lukuluha, mi yokame inawetu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Kakuli kame ku n̄olilwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Owabelelwe wene omuumba no kwa leya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">oluluweze, mane okuwe wene no kwa limuka okukola no luleya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">kakuli aana awoyo ona lukululwa, kame sapule okubitelela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">aana awoyo okwalilwe.<verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Abaange cwale aci, kame tuli aana no sepiso kanyi Isaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Kono kanyi enako ica woyo ona leiwa mu lutu kame ana kuyandisa woyo oleilwe ni Mebo, ku sili ngeso ni nako ino. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Kono elin̄olo ngasibine lyamba? Eli lili nji, “Ocite omubika ni mwanaye, kakuli omwana no mukati no mubika ka tamba okuyola esanda ni mwana wa woyo omukati ona lukuluka.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Cwale, abaange, katuli aana no mukati no mubika, kono kame tuli aana no mukati woyo ona lukuluka.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s">Mubabalele Etukuluho yenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Kakuli Jesu natu lukulula nji tu ikale ano kulukuluha. Cwale mongole, mane mulese oku bopiwa kame ku coko no ubika.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Cwale, mene Paulusi, kame ni myambela nji kame munatambula omupato, Kilesite katamba okutenda ono utokwa kwaanyi. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Kame ni pakela kame ku munu yonje woyo so ingena mu mupato, kame anungilwe okuteula etitaelo tonje no mulawo. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Kame muna kauhelwe kwa Kilesite anyi mwamba mukenisiwa mulibaka no mulawo, kame muna tundu ku sishemo sa Nyambe. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Kakuli mulibaka no Mebo, ni tumelo, tutatelele mu sepo okuluka. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Kakuli mwa Kilesite Jesu esi sili ni tuso kasa okwingena mu mupato simba okwa ingena, kono ni mu tumelo isebeza mu lilato. <verse eid="GAL 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Kame muna ituka wino, anyine ona mitikele nji mulese okukuteka eniti? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Ekelezo eyi kaitunda kwa yonyene woyo ona miisana. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Omumena no kucaniba kame ukulisa elin̄ende lyonje. <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Kame ni sepile kwa Mbumu nji ka mu tamba oku puluka indina okubita eyange, kono woyo omikataza mbatambula ekoto yaye, ku tende anyine simba anyine.<verse eid="GAL 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Abaange, kono nji mene, nisikutaza eyi no mupato, ngasibine aba nisi yandisiwa? Mu taba eyi eliwee lisisitalisa no sifapano nali tundisiwa. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Onyene awo ami ibetwa, kambe kame sa kufaule onyene.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Kakuli aanyi, abaange, kame mu na isanenwe etukuluho. Kono fela mulese okutusisa etukuluho yenu kanyi namuwana esibaka no lutu, kono okukumanena ni lilato mukutenda omubika no munjili. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Kakuli omulawo onje kame ona iyatetetwa mu liywi limweya nji, “Osinge woyo oyakile naye kanyi omo okusingela wenyene.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Kono aba mukuuma, mi kame mu lyela bamweya, mu mone nji mulese oukusinya mwenyene.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emebo ni Misebezi no Unu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Kono kame naamba nji, Mwende ni mebo, mi mulese oku tenda esi si lakazwa ku nyama. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Kakuli etakazo no nyama kame ilwisa Emebo mi etakazono Mebo kame ilwisa enyama kakuli yonje eyi yiili kailumelelana nji mulese okutenda eyo musinga. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Kono cwale nji kame mu etelelwa ku Mebo, kamusamo munji no mulawo.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Cwale emisebezi no nyama kame ilimukiwa, Okubuka, ouhule, ni mikwa no matilo, ni kwibaa. <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>Okulapele emilimu, ouloti, olutimbo, etifapano, omuna, okutweba, oulyangelino, etin̄ananyi, oukutaba. <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>olunya, outakwa, okulya ouyi ni injili ngeso. Kame ni nakulemusa kanyi omo ina kumilemuseta ba oweli nji awo atenda einu no ngeso katamba okuyola esanda no mubuso wa Nyambe.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Kono omuselo no Mebo ni lilato, kuwabelelwa, ni kozo, oukulema, omusa, ouwa, ni usepahali, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>wikokobezo, oukulema kakwisa omulawo okana eyi no ngeso. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Cwale awo ali kwa Kilesite Jesu kame ana kokotele enyama ba sifapano, ba mweya nesi sisingwa mane nikulakaziwa ku yonyene. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Nji kame tuyoya mulibaka no Mebo, tweende kame ngeso ni Mebo. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Tu lese oku bubekwa nambula tuso, mu uku shamaeta ni mu kufelana omuna.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s">Mukutuse Onjili ni Munjili ku Matata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Abaange, nji omunu kame aleminwe yo tenda einu no kwiiba, cwale aanyi mukwite emebo no ulapeli, mu mu use ni mebo no musa. Mi mutokomele naanyi mwendi mba mwetekiwa ngeso. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Mu kutuse omunjili ni munjili ku matata enu, mi mwiyatetete ngeso omulawo wa Kilesite. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Kakuli omunu aba anahana nji ni sinu sinene, cwale kandi kasa simweya, kame akoonga yonyene. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Kono mulesele omunu yonje atatube emisebezi yaye, mi cwale elibaka no kuyeema mbaliikala mwa yonyene yomboci, kasa kweyi no mukwae. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Kakuli omunu yonje mba shimbi omushimbo waye.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Mulese woyo ona iyetiwa eliywi akutabele einu yonje no kuwaba ni woyo omwiyeta.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Mulese okoonga, Nyambe ka yandisiwa, kakuli eso sonje akuna omunu, sokame eso sa kutule. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Kakuli woyo okunena enyama yaye, kame sa kutule eyi no koola ku nyama, kono woyo okuna ku Mebo, mba kutula ku Mebo omoyo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Tulese kukwangwa okutenda ouwa, kakuli kame satu kutule mu nako yayo nji katutamba ku zwafa. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Cwalehe, a ba tu sili ni sibaka, tu tende eyi no kuwaba kwaanu onje, onene abeetu aasikupumena.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etemuso ni Mulaano no Mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Komumone etitaku tinene eti nimi n̄olela ni Lyoko lyange luli. <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Onyene awo asinga okumonahaza wino mu nyama kame ami kandimeka okwingena mu mupato, nji cwale alese oku yandisiwa mulibaka no sifapano sa Kilesite. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Kakuli simba onyene awo ana ingene mu mupato kamemele omulawo, kono kame alakaza nji aanyi mwingene mu mupato nji akukanyise mu nyama yenu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Kono kanitamba okukanyisa konji esifapano sa Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite, mulibaka elyo elitunga nalikokoteliwa kwa mene mane ni mene ku litunga. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Kakuli simba okwingena simba okwaingena mu mupato kakwisa taba, kono okutenda esumbiwa no ubya. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Ekozo ni makeke ikale beulu yawo onje aenda ni mulawo mane ni beulu no Isilaele wa Nyambe.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Cwalehe omunu alese okuni kataza, kakuli kame nina shimbi ba lutu lwange amabote a Jesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Abaange esishemo sa Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite si ikale ni mebo yenu. Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
